@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@candidateId = replace-with-candidate-user-id
@jobId = replace-with-company-job-id
@requestId = replace-with-request-id
@hrToken = replace-locally
@staffToken = replace-locally
@candidateToken = replace-locally

### Permission metadata, no contact and no audit row
GET {{base}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}/contact-access
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### Request for this HR's company
POST {{base}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jobId":"{{jobId}}","reason":"Cần trao đổi vị trí Java."}

### Staff pending inbox
GET {{base}}/staff/contact-requests?status=PENDING&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Approve
POST {{base}}/staff/contact-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Reject with a separate reason
POST {{base}}/staff/contact-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Cần bổ sung mục đích tuyển dụng."}

### Each successful call commits exactly one log
GET {{base}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

### Staff filters, UTC half-open range
GET {{base}}/staff/contact-access-logs?userId={{candidateId}}&from=2026-11-25T17:00:00Z&to=2026-11-26T17:00:00Z&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Candidate identity always comes from JWT
GET {{base}}/me/contact-access-logs?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
